      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "ERA Tobin Estate agents are pleased to offer for sale this well presented spacious two bedroom, circa 70m² semi-detached residence in excellent condition throughout. Superb location in a cul de sac to the rear of the estate with off street parking with easy access to all local amenities. \r\nIdeally suited as a starter home or outstanding rental potential as an investment property. \r\n\r\nFeatures Include: O.F.C.H., hardwood front door, built in kitchen and utility, u.p.v.c double glazed windows and doors, window blinds, enclosed south facing rear garden, patio area, garden shed, off street parking, floor area 70m², BER C2.\r\n\r\nAccommodation Comprises: Entrance Hall:1.4 x 1.2, Sitting room:4.1 x 3.2, Kitchen / Dining room:4.3 x 3.4, Guest w.c:1.8 x 1.4, Utility:1.8 x 1.7, Landing: 2 x 1.9,Bathroom: 2.1 x 2, Master Bedroom:3.3 x 3.3, Bedroom 2:\t3.3 x 2.3."
